    <key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Open Dictation records audio from your microphone so it can be transcribed by the endpoint you configure. Recording only happens after you press Record or your dictation shortcut.</string>
    <!-- Local-dev HTTP: narrow exception template is NOT enabled by default.
         If your transcription endpoint is plain HTTP on LAN/localhost, see README
         "Local HTTP endpoints" for the documented opt-in (rebuild required). -->
</dict>
